cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this taxonomy, its labels, or this code, please cite the paper below."
title: "GSD-Sensitivity-Taxonomy"
abstract: >-
  A GSD-sensitive task taxonomy (D / M1 / M2) for remote sensing visual question
  answering, with taxonomy labels for ThinkGeo, RSVQA-LR, FloodNet and EarthVQA,
  and the evaluation code accompanying the IEEE GRSL letter.
type: software
authors:
